USAGE impz logs [OPTIONS] <NAME> [SERVICE]

ARGUMENTS

     NAME    imp name (Required)                 
  SERVICE    service name (default every service)

OPTIONS

         -f, --follow    keep printing what they write     
  -n, --lines=<lines>    lines to print first (default 100)


"
`;

