exports[`it prints the help of impz mcp as it always has 1`] = `
"Serve imps to a coding agent as MCP tools over stdio. The guard limits which imps the tools touch; it stops mistakes. For a real limit, run it with a scoped token (impz token new). (impz mcp v2.4.1)

USAGE impz mcp [OPTIONS] 

OPTIONS

  --prefix=<prefix>    touch only imps whose names start with this; new imps get it
    --allow=<allow>    touch these imps too (comma-separated names)                
              --all    touch every imp on impd                                     


"
`;

exports[`it prints the help of impz oauth as it always has 1`] = `
"Manage sign-ins to the public MCP route: clients, grants and approvals (impz oauth v2.4.1)

USAGE impz oauth client|grant|approve

COMMANDS

   client    Add, list, change or remove the clients that may sign in                                       
    grant    List or end the grants sign-ins made                                                           
  approve    Approve a sign-in by the code its page shows, as this named token; approve only one you started

Use impz oauth <command> --help for more information about a command.

"
`;

