exports[`it prints the help of impz oauth approve as it always has 1`] = `
"Approve a sign-in by the code its page shows, as this named token; approve only one you started (oauth approve)

USAGE oauth approve [OPTIONS] <CODE>

ARGUMENTS

  CODE    the code on the sign-in page (Required)

OPTIONS

  --scope=<scope>    read (the default), exec or manage; at most what the client asked for (Default: read)
    --imps=<imps>    limit it to these imps, such as 'dev-*' (comma-separated; default the token's)       
            --yes    approve without asking; needed when stdin is no terminal                             


"
`;

